flowchart TD
  A[SMS arrives: sender + body + original time] --> B[Safety, relevance and source identity]
  B -->|rejected| X[Stop or retain the appropriate minimal decision]
  B -->|eligible| C[Local parsing and durable evidence]
  C --> T[Transaction path: server parsing, category/card resolution, ledger dedupe]
  C --> F[Facts path: structured bill, balance, mandate or attempt facts]
  C -->|eligible unresolved input| AI[AI fallback: redacted input, validated proposal, device recheck]
  T --> O[Supported records or review; persistence ownership differs by path]
  F --> O
  AI --> O
  AI --> N[Supported explicit negative decision can dismiss]
  O --> L[User correction: private rules immediately; shared evidence through consent and review]
  N --> L
  L -. approved future rules .-> C
